<title>NORWAY: Alcatel Telettra wins NOK 600 mln BT deal.</title>
<headline>Alcatel Telettra wins NOK 600 mln BT deal.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Telettra said on Wednesday it had been awarded a four-year framework agreement by British Telecom, which could be worth about 600 million crowns.</p>
<p>The contract covers equipment for transmission of sound, data and pictures. The equipment will be produced in Norway, a statement to the Oslo bourse said.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
